    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d549">

                <pb facs="0967" n="867" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg867"/>

                <head>No. 549.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >St. Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1879-12-05"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 5,
                        1879</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington, District of Columbia:</hi></p>
                <p>Train containing Emperor’s baggage and part of suite blown up—partially
                    wrecked—near Moscow. No one hurt. Generally considered attempt on Emperor’s
                    life.</p>
                <closer><signed>HOFFMAN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
